		(descr "Seeed XIAO nRF52840 (Sense) Plus - DUAL-SIDED land for a reversible PCB. Each land is emitted on F.Cu and B.Cu; the B.Cu copy carries the pin that arrives there when the module is mounted on the opposite face (flip about the long axis, USB-C end fixed). Module back-side pads 24-29 (BAT+/-, SWD) are intentionally absent: they cannot be made reversible. Derived from Seeed OPL XIAO-nRF52840-Plus-SMD.")
